    "updated_at": "2023-07-03T10:16:46Z",
    "body": "I don't think this can be solved in the underlying source. Your example adds a 10ms delay between each chunk, whereas the OP wants to add a 10ms delay between each `read(view)`. That single `read(view)` could be populated with bytes from *multiple* chunks, if the view is large enough and the deadline has not been hit yet.",
